      "guid": null,
      "name": "Walther WA 2000 Sniper Rifle",
      "slug": "walther-wa-2000-sniper-rifle",
      "teaser": "Introduces WA 2000 to Tarkov",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2670.png",
      "downloads": 20576,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><em><strong>BUILT LIKE A BRICK, HITS LIKE A TRUCK</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Its big, its chunky and most importantly it can kill while blocking like 90% of your right view. The Walther WA 2000 is a very big and powerful sniper rifle made especially for sharpshooter, although apparently you can carry this chunk of metal brick around.</p>\n<p>Can be obtained from PMC and BOSS (Birdeye and Shturman)</p>\n<p>Can be bought from Peacekeeper and Jaeger (Most of the attachment is available at Peacekeeper LL2 &amp; LL3, you can do a barter from Jaeger at LL1 and he has some stuff in LL2)</p>\n<p>Requested by RaiRaiTheRaichu</p>\n<p>&lt;iframe width=“560” height=“315” src=“https://www.youtube.com/embed/qZo5-9UTjiQ?si=tkVJATheaepQYc7H” title=“YouTube video player” frameborder=“0” allow=“accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share” referrerpolicy=“strict-origin-when-cross-origin” allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;<br />\nAnimation by me</p>\n<p>Extra Texturing by RaiRaiTheRaichu</p>\n<p>Model from Call of Duty/WarZone By Activission Obtained from Acer’s Awesome Weapon Rigs</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instruction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip from the Gdrive</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n<p><em>P.S Why is this thing built like a 2x4 huge ahh plank. Also I threw in some black S&amp;B scopes cause aesthetic and authenticity</em></p>\n",
